  // =======================================================================
  // 第 1 部 第 6 章 sys「機体・エンジン・系統（Archer）」
  // The chapter 'sys' of the combined book (DESIGN 3.3 第 1 部 第 6 章). Written by W14 and revised by revise-sys after the fact
  // check, the beginner's read and the expert's read; registered in R2B with the chapter 'inst' (the two sections moved there,
  // sys.g1000 and sys.compass, leave this chapter in the same change: DESIGN 6.2 rule 2). The draft and its record:
  // textbook/rewrite/combined/drafts/sys.js, reports/W14.md・factcheck-sys.md・reader-sys.md・expert-sys.md・revise-sys.md. The 8
  // sections kept keep their ids and order; 4 new ones (sys.airframe, sys.piston, sys.eis, sys.radio — deep). The check
